# Style Guide

This page shows the live blog styles in one place so it is easier to tune the theme.

<section class="style-guide-section">
  <h2>Type Scale</h2>
  <p>The current theme uses <strong>Bitter</strong> for headings and <strong>Nunito Sans</strong> for body text and metadata.</p>

  <div class="style-guide-grid">
    <div class="style-guide-sample">
      <span class="style-guide-label">Site title bar: <code>28px</code></span>
      <article class="post-item style-guide-entry-sample">
        <header>
          <h2 class="post-title"><a href="#">Sample Post Title in Bitter</a></h2>
          <div class="post-meta">
            <time datetime="2026-04-07">April 7, 2026</time>
            <span class="post-tags">
              <a href="#">#style</a>, <a href="#">#type</a>, <a href="#">#guide</a>
            </span>
          </div>
        </header>
        <div class="post-content">
          <p>This is the live paragraph style at <strong>19px</strong>. It is meant to stay readable against the moss-black surface while still feeling a little old-web and journal-like.</p>
          <p class="permalink-line">
            <a href="#" class="permalink-link">
